Who are you?
How impudent you are to disturb my sleep.{VAR BE01}
Hmf...{VAR BE01}
You appear to possess a combination of
strength and kindness. Very well.{VAR BE01}
Make your best effort not to bore me
with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?{VAR BE01}

In the past, when I battled, the force
of my emotions shook me greatly.{VAR BE01}
When my power awoke, I came close to
destroying everything around me.{VAR BE01}
That weak person no longer exists...
Still, sometimes, my determination fails.{VAR BE01}
Always, I aspire to wrap up a victory
with elegance and grace.{VAR BE01}
I invite you to be my opponent
again in the future, if you wish.

Who's there?
Who is so uncouth as to disturb my sleep?{VAR BE01}
Hmf... It's you again.{VAR BE01}
Still, you possess that combination of
kindness and strength. Yet you seem{VAR BE00}
stronger than before...{VAR BE01}
Do be sure not to bore me with a
snooze-inducing battle, is that clear?{VAR BE01}

Alas! Even with the knowledge and skill
passed down in my family of Trainers,{VAR BE00}
I still can't win.{VAR BE01}
The reason I came here in the first place
was to encounter Trainers like you...

In the past, my untrained heart made my
power run wild.{VAR BE00}
I was forbidden to battle.{VAR BE01}
All I craved then was to experience the
pure excitement of battling like this.{VAR BE01}
Hee hee...
Although I'm embarrassed, I can't help{VAR BE00}
smiling right now.

You have defeated the
Pokémon League's Elite Four.{VAR BE01}
You have earned the right to
proceed to the Champion's room.{VAR BE01}
Making an entrance is not the point.{VAR BE01}
Once you're there, you'll need to
unleash your power to the fullest!
